dvdrental-postgres-starter
==========================

The project's own files (Docker, Compose, Makefile and docs) are licensed
under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

This project redistributes the "dvdrental" sample database
(dvdrental_db/datasources/dvdrental.sql), published by postgresqltutorial.com:
https://www.postgresqltutorial.com/postgresql-getting-started/postgresql-sample-database/

dvdrental is a PostgreSQL port of the MySQL Sakila sample database:
https://dev.mysql.com/doc/sakila/en/

